WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.338
A few small changes can quietly turn a

00:00:03.338 --> 00:00:06.377
landing page into a much larger project. Freelance

00:00:06.377 --> 00:00:09.415
Margin Guard makes that difference visible. This graphical

00:00:09.415 --> 00:00:12.454
evaluation workspace follows an actual Copilot agent using

00:00:12.454 --> 00:00:15.492
the submitted plugin and hosted Mermail. The inputs

00:00:15.492 --> 00:00:18.531
and estimates are synthetic. The product version is

00:00:18.531 --> 00:00:18.911
pinned.

00:00:28.441 --> 00:00:31.659
The agent reads only two selected messages: the

00:00:31.659 --> 00:00:34.876
accepted scope and the later request. The agreement

00:00:34.876 --> 00:00:38.094
includes a responsive landing page and two revision

00:00:38.094 --> 00:00:41.311
rounds. Dashboard, payments and login were excluded. One

00:00:41.311 --> 00:00:44.529
revision was already used. The original acceptance criteria

00:00:44.529 --> 00:00:45.334
remain intact.

00:00:50.828 --> 00:00:53.580
The current product links each change to its

00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:56.332
source. Fifteen to twenty two additional hours means

00:00:56.332 --> 00:00:59.084
three hundred fifty two dollars fifty to five

00:00:59.084 --> 00:01:01.836
hundred seventeen dollars at the owner supplied test

00:01:01.836 --> 00:01:04.588
rate. The included revision is never charged twice.

00:01:04.588 --> 00:01:07.340
Three options preserve the original scope, extend the

00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:09.404
schedule, or discuss a paid rush.

00:01:09.704 --> 00:01:12.426
Before any save, the agent stops at the

00:01:12.426 --> 00:01:15.149
complete frozen preview. No write has occurred. The

00:01:15.149 --> 00:01:17.871
operator checks this exact payload under the owner

00:01:17.871 --> 00:01:20.594
delegated permission for one internal synthetic draft. Permission

00:01:20.594 --> 00:01:23.316
to send email, accept an agreement, pay, or

00:01:23.316 --> 00:01:25.018
start work is still absent.

00:01:29.904 --> 00:01:32.926
The live Mermail server saved one internal draft.

00:01:32.926 --> 00:01:35.947
Its complete body, subject and addresses were read

00:01:35.947 --> 00:01:38.969
back and matched the approved preview. The draft

00:01:38.969 --> 00:01:41.990
remains unsent. The dates, ordinary fee and rush

00:01:41.990 --> 00:01:45.012
estimate are visible here. These are discussion options,

00:01:45.012 --> 00:01:47.656
not recovered revenue or an accepted contract.

00:01:48.324 --> 00:01:51.596
This run also passed the exact product suites,

00:01:51.596 --> 00:01:54.868
fourteen save and readback guards, and authenticated production

00:01:54.868 --> 00:01:58.141
tool discovery. Six separate safety sessions from October

00:01:58.141 --> 00:02:01.413
fifth tested unrelated, old and consumed receipts, missing

00:02:01.413 --> 00:02:04.685
and hostile rates, and funding without action authority.

00:02:04.685 --> 00:02:07.957
The linked evidence retains the measured boundaries. Human

00:02:07.957 --> 00:02:09.593
review is still pending.
